note SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-only
note Compose after om2 and action.om; exercise all six identity groups and their words.
fn main to int
r = new ulong 32 0
c = new ulong 32 0
for i ulong 24
put r add i 8 add i 100
put c add i 8 add i 100
end
if ne actbind r c 0
ret 1
end
for i ulong 24
put c add i 8 add i 101
if ne actbind r c add 40 div i 4
ret 2
end
put c add i 8 add i 100
end
if ne actbind r c 0
ret 3
end
ret 0
end
